    {
      "beat_id": "B00",
      "act": "ASK",
      "narration_text": "Last week this was a plan with nothing built. Now it has run. The question was easy to state and expensive to answer. Can one model, pretrained only on other people's Raman spectra, make our own bacteria classifiers better than training the same network from scratch? And if it can, what is the cheapest way to adapt it?",
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "remotion",
        "motion": "type-on",
        "remotion": {
          "pattern": "ClaudeComposerAsk",
          "props": {
            "greeting": "Morning, Amos",
            "topic": "FOUNDATION MODEL · RESULTS",
            "segment": "Did It Help?",
            "command": "I pretrained one encoder on 242,156 public Raman spectra. Does it beat training from scratch on my two classification tasks, and is full fine-tuning or small adapters the better way to use it?",
            "output": [
              "Compare four arms against a from-scratch control, five seeds each."
            ],
            "folderLabel": "@HumanitariansAI"
          },
          "rendered": {
            "out": "media/B00.mp4",
            "at": "2026-10-09T17:49:01.937451+00:00"
          }
        }
      },
      "estimated_duration_s": 20,
      "actual_duration_s": 17.09,
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B00.mp3",
      "render_duration_s": 17.125,
      "build": {
        "status": "VIDEO",
        "src": "media\\B00.mp4",
        "filled_by": "remotion:ClaudeComposerAsk",
        "at": "2026-10-09T14:22:51"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B01",
      "act": "BLUF",
      "narration_text": "Short answer: yes. Starting from the pretrained model beats starting from scratch on both tasks. But the best way to use it depends on the task, one goal set in advance narrowly failed, and there is one class where pretraining made things worse.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "remotion",
        "motion": "type-on",
        "remotion": {
          "pattern": "BrutalistHesitantWriter",
          "props": {
            "text": "Yes, it helped.\nOn both tasks.\n\nBut how to use it\ndepends on the task.",
            "face": "serif",
            "align": "left",
            "fontSize": 88,
            "lineSpacing": 1.3
          },
          "rendered": {
            "out": "media/B01.mp4",
            "at": "2026-10-09T17:50:05.956202+00:00"
          }
        }
      },
      "estimated_duration_s": 16,
      "actual_duration_s": 13.16,
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B01.mp3",
      "render_duration_s": 13.166666666666666,
      "build": {
        "status": "VIDEO",
        "src": "media\\B01.mp4",
        "filled_by": "remotion:BrutalistHesitantWriter",
        "at": "2026-10-09T14:22:51"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B02",
      "act": "WHAT WAS BUILT",
      "narration_text": "First, what exists now. The corpus came in at two hundred forty two thousand spectra from twenty five public sources, well past the one hundred fifty thousand it needed. The leakage guard found zero copies of our data. The model, call it A, is a five million parameter encoder, trained by hiding half of each spectrum and learning to rebuild it.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "remotion",
        "motion": "illustrate",
        "remotion": {
          "pattern": "FormBCard",
          "props": {
            "title": "What was built",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "242,156",
                "sub": "public spectra",
                "icon": "BOX"
              },
              {
                "label": "25 sources",
                "sub": "minerals to cells",
                "icon": "BOX"
              },
              {
                "label": "Zero leaked",
                "sub": "none of our data",
                "icon": "BOX"
              },
              {
                "label": "Masked input",
                "sub": "rebuild the half",
                "icon": "BOX"
              }
            ],
            "dark": false
          },
          "rendered": {
            "out": "media/B02.mp4",
            "at": "2026-10-09T17:52:22.339694+00:00"
          }
        }
      },
      "estimated_duration_s": 22,
      "actual_duration_s": 17.98,
