      "narration_text": "The first task: thirty bacterial isolates, tested on a separate measurement set. Full fine-tuning wins at eighty three point one, two point two points above scratch, with a confidence interval that excludes zero. Adapters land in between, and that gain cannot be told apart from zero. Head only comes last.",
