    {
      "beat_id": "B05",
      "act": "CLINICAL TASK",
      "narration_text": "The second task is hard in a different way: five clinical classes, trained on 2018 data and tested on 2019. Here the adapters win, at ninety one point nine. That is four point one points above scratch and two point three above full fine-tuning, significant in all five seeds, while training about a twentieth of the parameters.",
