    {
      "beat_id": "B08",
      "act": "WHERE IT HURT",
      "narration_text": "It did not help everywhere. One isolate, class six, fell from sixty three percent recall from scratch to about thirty five with pretraining, mostly mistaken for class seven. The pretrained features seem to merge the two. And classes eleven and seventeen stay below sixty percent for every arm: near perfect on validation, failing on test. Those are the classes the shift hits hardest.",
