    {
      "beat_id": "B09",
      "act": "THE NARROW MISS",
      "narration_text": "One goal was set before any results. One shared base of twenty megabytes, plus an adapter of about one megabyte per task, and that adapter should land within one point of the best arm on both tasks. On the clinical task it was the best. On the isolate task it finished one point two three behind. The goal failed, by about a quarter of a point. It stays failed.",
