    {
      "beat_id": "B10",
      "act": "WHAT IT DOES NOT SHOW",
      "narration_text": "And what this does not show. The base model was pretrained once, so run-to-run variation is unmeasured. Six of the eight learning rates landed at the edge of their grid, so some arms may be under-tuned, including the one that just missed. The scratch control used a schedule built for fine-tuning, which tilts slightly toward the pretrained start. And the test sets were scored exactly once.",
